<SPT><TTL>DELIVERY, STORAGE, AND HANDLING</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<SPT><TTL>Delivery</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Deliver materials in original rolls, packages, cartons, and containers with the name of manufacturer, brand, and model.  Inspect materials delivered 
to the site for damage.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Storage</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Store materials on site in enclosures or under protective covering.  Store [plastic piping and] rubber gaskets under cover out of direct sunlight.  
Do not store materials directly on ground.  Keep inside of pipes and fittings free from dirt and debris.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Handling</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Handle and carry pipe, fittings, valves, and accessories in such a manner as to ensure delivery to trench in sound undamaged condition.  Do not 
drag pipe.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
